  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results in Education for All Children (REACH) Multi Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of REACH will be to improve the learning outcomes of millions of children and young people who are enrolled in school, increase the numbers who stay enrolled until they finish the secondary level, and ensure that those children who are not enrolled do so and learn. These outcomes would be achieved using results-based mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
